Description: Forward, reverse, and transparent proxy server
 HTTP and SOCKS forward proxy, transparent TCP/UDP proxy, TCP and TLS
 stream proxy, and HTTP/TLS reverse proxy. Also supports TLS interception,
 ICAP inspection, authentication, ACL, and egress routing.
